message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Knowing Is Not Committing: Replicating MIT's weight-space edit and programming a truth-gated reflex into a 0.8B reasoning model (report)"
version: "0.4"
date-released: "2026-11-13"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24058693"
